      455.02,
      542.49,
      516.16
    ],
    "text": "THE Election Commission, in the exercise of the powers vested in it by Section 76A of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, hereby clarifies that the provision in Section 28 (2A) (b) of the Local Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 30 of 2003, which states \u201cnot less than fifty per centum of the total number of candidates nominated in the Additional Nomination Paper\u201d, shall be interpreted to mean \u201cNot less than fifty per centum of the candidates in the second nomination paper shall consist of women candidates.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
